DESCRIPTION:Event by Corning's Gaffer District\nCenterway Square\, Market 
 Street\nCorning\, NY\nDuration: 1 hr\nPublic\nCome join us for 'Story Time
  in the Square' in Centerway Square and enter a world of magic and imagina
 tion with local favorite\, Miss Sue from the Southeast Steuben County Libr
 ary.\n✦ Children and families are welcome to come together and enjoy cap
 tivating stories read aloud in the lively atmosphere of our city square. T
 his event promotes a passion for reading\, stimulates creativity\, and is 
 a perfect chance for the community to connect. Let's make unforgettable mo
 ments in the heart of Corning!\nStory Time occurs every other Tuesday at 1
 0:00 AM in Centerway Square (weather permitting) beginning June 9th throug
 h August 18th.\nCheck out the entire Summer in Downtown event series at ga
 fferdistrict.com and thank you to ous presenting sponsor Williams Toyota!\
 nFor updates on weather cancellations\, please check our social media (sto
 ries and this Facebook event page).\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calen
 dar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78416465/20260721100000
