DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a weekend filled with fun\, creativity and conne
 ction at the Great Escape on the Lakes — our annual tabletop board game 
 convention and geek adventure camp for all ages.\nFrom classic favorites t
 o exciting new games\, you’ll have the chance to play\, collaborate with
  board game designers\, join interactive workshops and even test out games
 ! Beyond the games\, the fun continues outdoors with sports\, arts and cra
 fts\, scenic nature trails and more! Whether you spend the entire event wi
 th us or drop in for a day\, you’ll find endless opportunities to play\,
  explore and make memories together.\nClick here for full details & to reg
 ister\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/784
 37311/20260819000000
STATUS:CANCELLED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78437311/20260819000000
