DESCRIPTION:The First TEDx in Watkins Glen\, NY.\nA racing pioneer\, a far
 mer\, a neurodiversity advocate\, an Emmy-level TV producer\, and a dozen 
 more\, all on one stage in the Finger Lakes for a single day. These are th
 e kinds of ideas that usually get shared in a city hundreds of miles away.
  This time they're happening here\, and you can be in the room for it. Spa
 rk questions\, disrupt thoughts\, elevate voices\, ignite your next move.\
 nClick here for full details and tickets\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://
 calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78433047/20260819080000
