BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Great Escape on the Lakes 2026
DTSTART:20260819T130000Z
DTEND:20260823T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260817T095527Z
UID:4ead4830c9af615ed8405a27aebe6f4b025dffac@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Games,Competitions,Family Fun
DESCRIPTION:Event by Community Board Game Network\, Great Escape Adventure
 s - Ithaca and 4 others\nThe Y at Watson Woods\n9612 Gulf Rd\nPainted Post
 \, NY\nPublic\nBoard Game Convention & Geek Adventure Camp. August 19 - 23
 rd\, 2026. Join us for Great Escape on the Lakes 2026 in the Finger Lakes 
 Region of Upstate\, NY. #GEOTL26\nREGISTER HERE: https://greatescapeadvent
 ures.net/GEOTL/\nSchedule Gaming Events Here (FREE):\nhttps://tabletop.eve
 nts/.../great-escape-on-the-lakes-2026\nFacebook Group (Announcements & pi
 ctures) - https://www.facebook.com/groups/greatescapeonthelakes\nDiscord 
 – Chat with other players! Announcements\, planning\, and more. Be sure 
 to self assign roles for GEOTL and any other channels you wish to see. - h
 ttps://discord.gg/s2xPPFGfT8\nNEW FOR 2026 - Annual Tabletop Game Design C
 ontest – rewarding first place with a free consulting session with publi
 shed industry experts\, such as Rob Dougherty\, CEO of Wise Wizard Games!\
 nAbout Us:\nWe are an annual fun-for-the-whole-family tabletop board game 
 convention and geek adventure camp located in the very heart of the Finger
  Lakes in Upstate NY. In addition to tabletop games\, LARP\, and RPG’s\,
  other activities include primitive woodcraft\, axe throwing\, climbing wa
 ll\, finger lakes nature trails\, wading creek\, archery\, miniature paint
 ing\, leatherworking\, disc golf\, pickleball\, corn hole\, GaGa ball\, gi
 ant lego construction zone\, basketball\, volleyball\, and more.\nThe Y at
  Watson Woods is a 400-acre family event and retreat center in New York’
 s stunning Southern Finger Lakes region. Corning\, Watkins Glen\, and Hamm
 ondsport are just minutes away\, serving as the perfect places to enjoy Se
 neca Lake\, Keuka Lake\, Wineries & Cider Houses\, Watkins Glen Internatio
 nal Speedway\, Watkins Glenn State Park\, the Corning Museum of Glass\, Co
 rning’s Gaffer District world famous for glass blowing\, and the natural
  beauty and rolling hills of the Southern Tier.\nVENDORS & BOARD GAME DESI
 GNERS selling your wares may Register Here: https://greatescapeadventures.
 net/great-escape-on-the.../\nPLEASE SHARE AND INVITE TO HELP US GET THE WO
 RD OUT:\nWe increased our attendance target to 500 now that we have moved 
 to a larger facility. Attendance was about 250 in both 2025\, and 2024. Th
 ank you for your help in building the community!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - 
 https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78419970/20260819090000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78419970/20260819090000
