DESCRIPTION:Event by Atwater Wine\nAtwater Wine\nDuration: 3 hr\nPublic\nT
 aylor Hurd is a singer-songwriter from Western New York working in the New
  York and Boston areas. Taylor uses creative songwriting and delves into t
 he genres of Alternative and Indie\, exploring the world of interpersonal 
 relationships and the struggles that come with human relations. She strive
 s to create music that might aid others in coping with feelings of abuse a
 nd addiction\, aiming to help others by sharing her experiences and hoping
  to make someone out there feel a little more seen.\nPlease join us for Ta
 ylor's music\, wine by the glass or bottle\, cocktails\, mocktails\, chees
 e or charcuterie plates\, and small bites.\nIndustry and Club Discounts!\n
