CATEGORIES:Literature
DESCRIPTION:Event by Watkins Glen Public Library\nWatkins Glen Elementary 
 School\n612 S Decatur St\, Watkins Glen\, NY\nDuration: 6 hr\nPublic\nThe 
 Watkins Glen Public Library's annual book sale will be held on Saturday\, 
 August 22nd from 10am-4pm in the Watkins Glen Elementary School's multi-us
 e room. This space will be accessible via the library parking lot. You may
  also park in the additional school lots.\nAVAILABLE ITEMS\nAdult hardcove
 r and paperback fiction\, non-fiction\, young adult\, and children's books
 . Puzzles\, board games\, vinyl records\, DVDs\, and more! Sale items are 
 a mix of library discards and public donations.\nSpecial access at 9:00am!
  Stay tuned for more info.\nMETHODS OF PAYMENT: Cash\, check\, Paypal\, cr
 edit/debit\nBAG SALE: $10 Bag/Box Sale from 3:00pm-4:00pm. Bags/boxes are 
 available\, or you may bring your own. No limit on size.\nFREE ITEMS FOR E
 DUCATORS:\nEmployees of the WGCSD\, OMCSD\, My Place Daycare\, Family Play
  and Resource Center\, and Schuyler Head Start can shop up to 20 items at 
 NO COST. If you are an educator from outside Schuyler County\, please spea
 k to a staff member directly and we will try to accommodate. Proof of empl
 oyment is not required. We work on the honor system!\nLITTLE FREE LIBRARIE
 S:\nIf you are managing a Little Free Library in Schuyler County\, you can
  shop for up to 20 items at NO COST. Again\, honor system.\nDONATIONS\nWe 
 are accepting donations in good condition until July 31\, 2026. Donations 
 must be dropped off at the Circulation Desk during open hours.\nPlease con
 tact wgldirector@stls.org if you have any questions or call (607) 535-2346
 .\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/7841988
 8/20260822100000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78419888/20260822100000
END:VEVENT
