DESCRIPTION:Event by Friends of the Chemung River Watershed\, Inc.\nWyncoo
 p Creek Boat Launch - Chemung\, NY\nPublic\nJoin the River Friends for a m
 onthly cleanup throughout the Chemung River Watershed. In August we'll be 
 cleaning up the Wyncoop Creek Boat Launch.\nDirections to Wyncoop Creek Ro
 ad Boat Launch from Elmira area: Take I-86 East to Exit 59 (Route 427). Tu
 rn right at the end of the exit ramp onto Wyncoop Creek Road. The dirt roa
 d leading to the launch is about 50 yards away. A River Friends sign will 
 be posted at the road entrance.\nAll materials will be provided\, all you 
 need is yourself dressed in weather appropriate clothes you don’t mind g
 etting a little dirty\, and maybe a friend to help out too! We'll have a s
 hort safety talk before we embark on our clean-up efforts in the Chemung R
 iver Watershed.\nRegistration is not required for this FREE event but is g
 reatly appreciated so we know how many folks to expect.\nOur clean-ups are
  funded through various grants and sponsorships. Individual donations are 
 not required but are greatly appreciated!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https:/
 /calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78440332/20260829100000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
