  custom-blended organic meditation tea. This gathering is designed to supp
 ort the mind\, soul\, and spirit through simple yet powerful practices.\nP
 articipants will:\nNurture the Mind through wisdom teachings that encourag
 e greater awareness and expanded consciousness.\nNourish the Soul with the
  deeply restorative Max Meditation™ technique.\nNourish the Spirit throu
 gh prayer and intentional reflection\, creating space for clarity\, peace\
 , and renewed strength.\nGather in Community in a welcoming space for pers
 onal growth\, connection\, and spiritual renewal.\nWhether you're brand ne
 w to meditation or have an established practice\, everyone is welcome.\nUp
 coming 2026 dates:\nJuly 26\nAugust 30\nSeptember 27\nOctober 25\nNovember
  29\nDecember 27\nHosted by Paula Lee Healing at Essence Healing.\nEvent d
 etails can be found here:\nhttps://www.paulaleehealing.com/event-calendar\
