DESCRIPTION:Event by Elmira Downtown Development\, Inc\nWisner Park\nDurat
 ion: 4 hr\nPublic\nDowntown Elmira's beloved Wisner Market is back and bet
 ter than ever. Join us every Wednesday in Wisner Park from 10:00 AM to 2:0
 0 PM for a mid-week tradition that brings the community together all summe
 r long.\nOpening Day: Wednesday\, June 3\nEvery Wednesday | June 3 – Sep
 tember 30 | 10:00 AM – 2:00 PM\nWisner Park\, Elmira NY\nBrowse more tha
 n 30 vendors offering fresh produce\, cut flowers\, handmade crafts\, uniq
 ue local goods\, and more. Grab lunch from some of the best food trucks an
 d local restaurants in the area\, enjoy live music\, and soak up everythin
 g that makes downtown Elmira special.\nLive Music Sponsored by Southern Ti
 er Custom Fabricators\nGood vibes and great tunes are on the playlist ever
 y week. Pull up a seat and enjoy live performances throughout the market.\
 nStory Time at the Market Presented by Farm Credit East and Gannon Associa
 tes Insurance\nNew This Year: More to Come! We're adding exciting new prog
 ramming to the 2026 season. Stay tuned for announcements you won't want to
  miss what's in store. ~ Sponsored by SerVU Credit Union\nVisit elmiradown
 town.com for updates\, vendor info\, and more.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - ht
 tps://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78440327/20260819100000
