 od vibes. Whether you’re chasing a PR\, jogging your first mile\, or bri
 nging the whole family along for a walk\, everyone is welcome.\nWe meet ev
 ery Wednesday at 5:45 PM for a group stretch\, then head out for the run a
 t 6:00 PM sharp—rain or shine. No pressure\, no pace requirements—just
  show up\, get moving\, and enjoy the run together.\nAfter the run\, all c
 lub members receive 10% off their tab\, making it the perfect way to cool 
 down\, hang out\, and connect with fellow runners.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar 
