CATEGORIES:Boats,Nature
DESCRIPTION:Event by Friends of the Chemung River Watershed\, Inc.\nGrove 
 Street Boat Launch\nPublic\nNew in 2026! We're expanding our paddle progra
 m and adding monthly evening paddles! Join expert paddler Jim Pfiffer and 
 our Volunteer River Guides on the Chemung River for a short and sweet guid
 ed paddle. We'll enjoy a unique experience on the river with a relaxing pa
 ddle from Fitch's Bridge Boat Launch to Grove Street Boat Launch in Elmira
 \, NY.\nMeet us at Grove Street Boat Launch at 5pm to leave your vehicles\
 , then we'll shuttle all paddlers to Fitch's Bridge to go over river safet
 y guidelines and launch our watercraft by 5:30pm. See detailed rental inst
 ructions below.\nPlease dress for the weather and bring/wear water shoes\,
  a hat\, sunscreen\, a re-usable water bottle\, a change of clothes is rec
 ommended\, and a life jacket if you have one. LIFE JACKETS ARE REQUIRED\; 
 we will have life jackets available if you don't have one. Snacks are also
  recommended!\nThe FCRW Kayak Rental price includes the guided river tour 
 and a kayak rental. If you need one\, we have a limited number of kayaks a
 vailable. We will meet at Grove Street Boat Launch at 5pm. Paddlers will l
 eave their vehicles at Grove Street. FCRW will shuttle paddlers to Fitch's
  Bridge for a safety talk and then launch our watercraft by 5:30pm.\nThe B
 YOK (Bring your own kayak) price includes the guided river tour. Paddlers 
 bringing their own craft will drop them off at the start of the paddle at 
 Fitch's Bridge Boat Launch between 4-4:45pm where an FRCW Staff will watch
  over them\, then travel to Grove Street Boat Launch to meet Cait and the 
 rest of the paddlers at 5pm. Paddlers will leave their vehicles at Grove S
 treet. FCRW will shuttle paddlers to Fitch's Bridge for a safety talk and 
 then launch our watercraft by 5:30pm.\nFitch's Bridge Boat Launch - Off He
 ndy Hollow Road\, Elmira\, NY 14905\nGrove Street Boat Launch - 36 Grove S
 t\, Elmira\, NY 14905\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/guided-evenin
 g-paddle-fitchs-bridge-to-grove-street-boat-launch-tickets-1988813358292?f
 bclid=IwY2xjawTuLgxwZG9mBWV4dG4DYWVtAjEwAHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMD
 A4OTIAAR5kEax_cBHqGrHwv0HNwadMAGeph7KdEPlncOHCQBy3cgnB52KiEjQVJFinRw_aem_Z
 KknTCUmkIS-oDhuamdNxw.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o
 9b0uzpj/event/78440335/20260916170000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/guided-evening-paddle-fitchs-bridge-to-gr
 ove-street-boat-launch-tickets-1988813358292?fbclid=IwY2xjawTuLgxwZG9mBWV4
 dG4DYWVtAjEwAHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5kEax_cBHqGrHwv0HNwa
