SUMMARY:Mystic Pizza: A New Musical
DTSTART:20260926T233000Z
DTEND:20260927T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260817T095527Z
UID:37bbb07e06c9feb98a990f88f9f07f36208c26ee@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Performing Arts,Music
DESCRIPTION:Event by Clemens Center\n207 Clemens Center Pkwy\nElmira\, NY\
 nPublic\nThe M&T Bank 2025-26 Broadway Season presents\nMystic Pizza\nSatu
 rday\, September 26\, 2026 @ 7:30pm\nSunday\, September 27\, 2026 @ 2:00pm
 \nSeason tickets on sale now at ClemensCenter.org\nIndividual tickets will
  be on sale at a later date\n---------------\n"An undeniably charming new 
 musical serving up 1980s nostalgia!" Stage Raw\nMystic Pizza: A New Musica
 l delivers the beloved story from the iconic hit film driven by a score pa
 cked with unforgettable hits from the ’80s and ’90s. Follow best frien
 ds Kat\, Daisy\, and Jojo as they navigate the complexities of friendship 
 and romance—all while slinging slices at a small-town pizza joint. Burst
 ing with laugh-out-loud moments\, heartfelt storytelling\, and chart-toppe
 rs including “Hit Me With Your Best Shot\,” “Hold On\,” and “Man
 ic Monday\,” Mystic Pizza is a joyful celebration of chasing dreams\, li
 felong bonds\, and finding your place in the world.\nCritics are hungry fo
 r more: Stage Scene LA calls Mystic Pizza a “surefire hit\,” featuring
  “one show-stopping dance sequence after another\,” while NJ Stage pra
 ises the show as “funny\, heartwarming\, and nostalgic".\nAge Recommenda
 tion: Ages 13+\nDates/times/programs/prices are subject to change.\n------
 ---------\nWe acknowledge these business members who support the Clemens C
 enter programming throughout the year:\nArnot Health • Chemung Supply 
 • Chemung Canal Trust Company • Guthrie • Streeter Associates\n\nSou
 rce: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78439038/202609
 26193000
GEO:42.08921;-76.804956
LOCATION:Clemens Center\, 207 Clemens Center Parkway\, Elmira\, New York\,
  14901
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78439038/20260926193000
END:VEVENT
