BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Opening Reception - "The Line That Connects Us All" at The ARTS Co
 uncil\, Corning
DTSTART:20261002T210000Z
DTEND:20261002T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260817T095527Z
UID:1b871789ab7f47926809175fb6f3ffd7216a0496@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art,Connection,Community
DESCRIPTION:An Indivisible Corning-Elmira community art project\nWe are an
 swering Fall of Freedom's nationwide call for creative resistance\, culmin
 ating in a public exhibit the weekend of October 2-4 (for more info: https
 ://www.falloffreedom.com/). Our exhibit will be titled "The Line That Conn
 ects Us All" — a visual representation of our shared humanity and how ou
 r differences can connect and strengthen us as a community.\nParticipants 
 will make a self-portrait from a line drawing (as simple or detailed as yo
 u wish). The line will extend to the edge of the paper on either side. The
 se drawings will be hung so that the lines meet up\, resulting in a contin
 uous unbroken line of connection between all of us. We have scheduled seve
 ral drawing sessions over the next two months\, led by a professional arti
 st. Choose the session that works best for you - you only need to attend o
 ne. All skill levels are welcome!\nDrawing sessions (Click a link to regis
 ter for the session of your choice. The exact location will be given after
  you register!)\nMonday\, August 17\, 2-4 pm in Elmira. Registration link:
  https://mobilize.us/s/wRBKYy\nMonday\, August 31\, 5-7 pm in Corning. Reg
 istration link: https://mobilize.us/s/I5A2Y5\nThursday\, September 10\, 3-
 5 pm in Corning. Registration link: https://mobilize.us/s/GtLfeG\nThursday
 \, September 24\, 5-7 pm in Elmira. Registration link: https://mobilize.us
 /s/1zzMNu\nExhibit Opening (mark your calendar!)\nFriday\, October 2\, 5-7
  pm at the Arts Council of the Southern Finger Lakes\, 79 W. Market St.\, 
 Corning\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/7
 8435017/20261002170000
GEO:42.144133;-77.057571
LOCATION:The Arts Council of the Southern Finger Lakes\, 79 West Market St
 reet\, Corning\, New York\, 14830\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78435017/20261002170000
END:VEVENT
